          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild perianal excoriation. No fissure, fistula, haemorrhoids, masses, hard stool, or blood. Anal wink present. Resting tone slightly reduced; voluntary squeeze present but feels somewhat weak."
      }
